{"title":"The Mother of Stone","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Mother of Stone is a named <a href=\"#/monster/basilisk-matriarch\">Basilisk Matriarch</a> seen at level 30.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Mother of Stone</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>The Stonegaze Sanctum</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 2×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"5705\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-mother-of-stone\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><p class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for The Mother of Stone yet.</p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/3feaaab0e2d4d8f2444e.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>The Mother of Stone</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/basilisk-matriarch\">Basilisk Matriarch</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>30</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>1,593</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>5 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}